{"articleNo":"55644","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=55644&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012 정부지원 창업스쿨 실전창업교육 모집 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.05.23","hit":"5321","attachments":[{"name":"금오공대-창업홍보물.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=55644&attachNo=70354"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&lt; 2012 정부지원 창업스쿨 실전창업교육 모집&gt;</span></strong></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"WIDOWS: 2; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; DISPLAY: inline !important; FONT: 13px/19px 돋움; WHITE-SPACE: normal; ORPHANS: 2; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); WORD-SPACING: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px\">중소기업청 주최, 소상공인진흥원 주관, 금오공과대학교에서 진행하는 실전창업교육과정에 많은 참여를 부탁드립니다.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><br>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\">◈ 교육 목적</p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;창업에 필요한 기본적 내용을 종합적으로 교육하여 창업지식 및 자금을 지원하여 개인창업과정에 도움을 주고자 함</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">◈ 교육생 특전</p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;정부우선자금 지원대상자 지정(최대 5000만원), 수료증 발급(80% 이상 출석 시)</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">◈ 교육 일정 및 내용</p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"50\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"37\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">회차</p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"50\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"111\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">일자</p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"50\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"325\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">세부교육 프로그램명</p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"50\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"101\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">모집인원</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">(선착순)</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"28\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"37\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">1회차</p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"28\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"111\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">6.25~7.6</p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-R